        name: "Dalia Sefet",
        variantType: "STEVE",
        version: "1.0.0"
    },
    data: {
        ActionData: {
            ActionEventSet: {
                ON_INTERACTION: [
                    {
                        Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        ArmorDropChances: [0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f],
        ArmorItems: [
            {},
            {},
            {},
            {}
        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "dalia_fetch_in"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_dalia_fetch_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 25,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Pour it around the roots",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/dalia/reward"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "claim_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Two flasks of mystic water. Where does a traveller even find such a thing dry-season? No — do not tell me. Give it here before the crowns give up on us. Hold the ladder and watch my grandmother's trees remember what green was."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dalia — the palms drink",
                    Label: "claim"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "dalia_fetch_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 24,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The palms took your water like they had been waiting for it their whole lives. There is fruit setting on the west row already. My children will taste a date this season because a stranger carried water into a dying town. Do not let anyone tell you that is a small thing."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I cannot pay you what that was worth — nobody could — but the coin was real and so is my thanks. The well is still a hole full of dust, mind. Water a tree and you save a tree. Kill the pump out on the Oasis and you save the whole Reach."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dalia — the crop holds",
                    Label: "done"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "dalia_fetch_started"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_dalia_fetch_in"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 15,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over 2 mystic water",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative turnin cobblemon:mystic_water 2 dalia_fetch_in"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "turnin_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "I will find the water",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You came back. My palms are past what a bucket from the puddle can fix — the roots are salt-burned and stubborn. What they want is mystic water, the living kind, and two flasks would soak the whole grove down to the taproot. Bring me two and I will find the coin to thank you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Two flasks of mystic water, that is all. I know it is a strange ask from a farmer, but ordinary water runs straight through burned roots. The mystic sort holds. Anglers pull it from the deep pools — ask the ones who fish where the water still runs."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dalia — the dying grove",
                    Label: "ask"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Is there anything I can do for the grove?",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add dalia_fetch_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "ask"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_dalia_fetch_done"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "help_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Stay strong",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "My date palms have gone brown at the crown. Forty years my family watered them from the town well, and now the well is a hole full of dust. You cannot irrigate with a rumor."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "They say the Company is growing an ocean of wheat up north with water that used to be ours. I would not know. I only know my roots are dry and my children are thirsty."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "If you are heading out into the wild, mind the sandstorms. They roll in fast and they do not care whose town you are trying to save."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Wait - are you the irrigation surveyor the regional office promised us in spring? (she looks you over) No. No, you keep your Pokemon fed and you look people in the eye. Forget I asked."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dalia Sefet",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
